{"title":"Barrow Troll","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 32 Troll that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/barrow-troll\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/barrow-troll?lv=30\">Lv 30 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/barrow-troll?lv=31\">Lv 31 <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/barrow-troll?lv=32\">Lv 32 <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/barrow-troll?lv=33\">Lv 33 <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/barrow-troll?lv=34\">Lv 34 <span>2</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/barrow-troll?lv=30\" title=\"Pick level 30\"><td><b>30</b></td><td>118</td><td>21</td><td>1,500</td><td class=\"muted\">354 · 29.4 · 4,500</td><td>1</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/barrow-troll?lv=31\" title=\"Pick level 31\"><td><b>31</b></td><td>124</td><td>21.6</td><td>1,550</td><td class=\"muted\">372 · 30.2 · 4,650</td><td>2</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/barrow-troll?lv=32\" title=\"Pick level 32\"><td><b>32</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>131</td><td>22.1</td><td>1,600</td><td class=\"muted\">393 · 30.9 · 4,800</td><td>2</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/barrow-troll?lv=33\" title=\"Pick level 33\"><td><b>33</b></td><td>137</td><td>22.7</td><td>1,650</td><td class=\"muted\">411 · 31.8 · 4,950</td><td>2</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/barrow-troll?lv=34\" title=\"Pick level 34\"><td><b>34</b></td><td>145</td><td>23.2</td><td>1,700</td><td class=\"muted\">435 · 32.5 · 5,100</td><td>2</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>Trollbarrow</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 9</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-143\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><p class=\"muted\">No sightings yet.</p>\n      <h2>Named ones <span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:14px\">(1)</span></h2><div class=\"named-grid\"><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/gorm-underhill\"><img src=\"data/img/58da13faf5b344c76170.webp\" alt=\"\"><b>Gorm Underhill</b><span>Lv 34</span></a></div>\n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Troll: <a href=\"#/monster/troll\">Troll</a> <span class=\"muted\">(17)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/chalk-troll\">Chalk Troll</a> <span class=\"muted\">(28)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/58da13faf5b344c76170.webp\" alt=\"Barrow Troll\"></div><h3>Barrow Troll</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>32 <span class=\"muted\">(seen 30–34)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Troll</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>crush · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>131</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>22.1</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>1600</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>5.3 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>8 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}